{"product_id":"naruto-sakuras-story-love-riding-on-the-spring-breeze-naruto-novels","title":"Naruto: Sakura's Story--Love Riding on the Spring Breeze (Naruto Novels)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA new series of prose novels, straight from the worldwide Naruto franchise. Naruto’s allies and enemies take center stage in these fast-paced adventures, with each volume focusing on a particular clanmate, ally, team…or villain.A new series of prose novels, straight from the worldwide Naruto franchise. Naruto’s allies and enemies take center stage in these fast-paced adventures, with each volume focusing on a particular clan mate, ally, team…or villain.The Great Ninja War did not only harm adults, but left many damaged children behind. Medical ninja Sakura travels the land, opening clinics dedicated to healing children of the mental trauma they experienced. She learns of a series of attacks against Konoha, and her investigation leads to an impossible conclusion: Sasuke is the terrorist mastermind behind them all! Using her skills and her heart, Sakura strives to clear Sasuke’s name and bring the real perpetrator to justice.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ohsaki Tomohito\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421584423\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45872023077017,"sku":"13RA9781421584423","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f44ab623f6_Naruto_Sakura_s_Story--Love_Riding_on_the_Spring_Breeze__Naruto_Novels.jpg?v=1762614435","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/naruto-sakuras-story-love-riding-on-the-spring-breeze-naruto-novels","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}